                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela cipanzi catatu cisyeede, njoobiinzya mumulilo, kuti nkabasalazye mbubonya mbuli insiliva mbwiisalazigwa, akubalingula mbuli ingolida mbwiilingulwa. Elyo bayookwiilila izina lyangu, ambebo njoobavwiila. Njooamba kuti mbantu bangu, abalo bayooti, Jehova ngu-Leza wangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
